      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "तारकं प्रजगादाऽसौ गच्छ देवीं महाबल । सामयुक्तं वदाऽऽशु त्वं महामायां महासुर ॥२६॥",
      "text": "ಅವನು ತಾರಕನಿಗೆ ಹೇಳಿದನು — ಹೇ ಮಹಾಬಲನೇ, ಮಹಾಸುರನೇ, ನೀನು ದೇವಿಯ ಬಳಿಗೆ ಹೋಗು; ಮಹಾಮಾಯೆಗೆ ಶೀಘ್ರವಾಗಿ ಸಾಮಯುಕ್ತವಾದ ಮಾತನ್ನು ಹೇಳು. ॥೨೬॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        27
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "तं प्रणम्य ययौ वेगाच्छक्तेः सन्निधिमादरात् । तारको मानितस्तैस्तु देवैः परमदारुणः ॥२७॥",
      "text": "ಪರಮದಾರುಣನಾದ ತಾರಕನು ಅವನಿಗೆ ಪ್ರಣಮಿಸಿ, ಆದರದಿಂದ ವೇಗವಾಗಿ ಶಕ್ತಿಯ ಸನ್ನಿಧಿಗೆ ಹೋದನು; ಮತ್ತು ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಆ ದೇವತೆಗಳಿಂದ ಸನ್ಮಾನಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟನು. ॥೨೭॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        28
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "नत्वा शक्तिं महामायां कृतांजलिपुटोऽसुरः । तारकस्तामुवाचाऽथ सामयुक्तं वचः खलः ॥२८॥",
      "text": "ಖಳನಾದ ಆ ಅಸುರ ತಾರಕನು ಅಂಜಲಿಪುಟವನ್ನು ಜೋಡಿಸಿದವನಾಗಿ ಮಹಾಮಾಯೆಯಾದ ಶಕ್ತಿಗೆ ನಮಸ್ಕರಿಸಿ, ಬಳಿಕ ಅವಳಿಗೆ ಸಾಮಯುಕ್ತವಾದ ಮಾತನ್ನು ಹೇಳಿದನು. ॥೨೮॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        29
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "तारकासुर उवाच । शृणु शक्ते महामाये आगतः स मदासुरः । दर्शनार्थं च ते मातस्तेनाऽहं प्रेषितोऽधुना ॥२९॥",
      "text": "ತಾರಕಾಸುರನು ಹೇಳಿದನು — ಹೇ ಮಹಾಮಾಯೆಯಾದ ಶಕ್ತಿಯೇ, ಕೇಳು; ಹೇ ಮಾತೆಯೇ, ಆ ಮದಾಸುರನು ನಿನ್ನ ದರ್ಶನಕ್ಕಾಗಿ ಬಂದಿದ್ದಾನೆ; ಅವನಿಂದ ನಾನು ಈಗ ಕಳುಹಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿದ್ದೇನೆ. ॥೨೯॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        30
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "तेनोदितं च शक्ते त्वं वचनं शृणु मानदे । भक्तेन भक्तिसंयुक्तं भावज्ञे जगदंबिके ॥३०॥",
      "text": "ಹೇ ಮಾನದೆಯೇ, ಶಕ್ತಿಯೇ, ಭಾವಜ್ಞೆಯೇ, ಜಗದಂಬಿಕೆಯೇ, ಭಕ್ತನಾದ ಅವನಿಂದ ಹೇಳಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಭಕ್ತಿಸಂಯುಕ್ತವಾದ ಮಾತನ್ನು ನೀನು ಕೇಳು. ॥೩೦॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        31
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "अस्माकं कुलदेवी तु त्वमेवात्र न संशयः । असुरा हि वयं सर्वे त्वदीयाः सेवका मताः ॥३१॥",
      "text": "ನೀನೇ ನಮ್ಮ ಕುಲದೇವಿಯು, ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ಸಂಶಯವಿಲ್ಲ; ಏಕೆಂದರೆ ಅಸುರರಾದ ನಾವೆಲ್ಲರೂ ನಿನ್ನ ಸೇವಕರೆಂದು ಪರಿಗಣಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿದ್ದೇವೆ. ॥೩೧॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        32
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "यत्राऽसुरा विराजंति सुरास्तत्र हतप्रभाः । भवंति नात्र संदेहः स्वभावाच्छत्रवो मताः ॥३२॥",
      "text": "ಎಲ್ಲಿ ಅಸುರರು ವಿರಾಜಿಸುತ್ತಾರೋ ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಸುರರು ಕಾಂತಿಹೀನರಾಗುತ್ತಾರೆ, ಇದರಲ್ಲಿ ಸಂದೇಹವಿಲ್ಲ; ಸ್ವಭಾವದಿಂದಲೇ ಅವರು ಶತ್ರುಗಳೆಂದು ಪರಿಗಣಿತರಾಗಿದ್ದಾರೆ. ॥೩೨॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        33
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "अतो देवान् समुत्सृज्य तिष्ठ त्वं पूजिताऽसुरैः । अस्माकं शत्रवो देवास्त्वदीयाः शत्रवो मताः ॥३३॥",
      "text": "ಆದುದರಿಂದ ದೇವತೆಗಳನ್ನು ಸಂಪೂರ್ಣವಾಗಿ ತೊರೆದು ಅಸುರರಿಂದ ಪೂಜಿತಳಾಗಿ ನೀನು ಇರು; ನಮ್ಮ ಶತ್ರುಗಳಾದ ದೇವತೆಗಳು ನಿನ್ನ ಶತ್ರುಗಳೆಂದೇ ಪರಿಗಣಿತರಾಗಿದ್ದಾರೆ. ॥೩೩॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        34
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "प्रणमंतो वयं यावत्तावद्देवनिकृंतनम् । करिष्यामो न संदेहस्तस्मान् मातस्त्यजाऽऽशु तान् ॥३४॥",
      "text": "ನಾವು ನಮಸ್ಕರಿಸುತ್ತಿರುವಷ್ಟರಲ್ಲಿಯೇ ದೇವತೆಗಳ ಸಂಹಾರವನ್ನು ಮಾಡಿಯೇ ತೀರುತ್ತೇವೆ, ಸಂದೇಹವಿಲ್ಲ; ಆದುದರಿಂದ ಹೇ ಮಾತೆಯೇ, ಶೀಘ್ರವಾಗಿ ಅವರನ್ನು ತ್ಯಜಿಸು. ॥೩೪॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        35
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "एकं पक्षं समाश्रित्य तिष्ठ त्वं जगदंबिके । असुराणां सुराणां वा पूजिता सततं परे ॥३५॥",
      "text": "ಹೇ ಜಗದಂಬಿಕೆಯೇ, ಪರೆಯೇ, ಅಸುರರ ಅಥವಾ ಸುರರ ಒಂದು ಪಕ್ಷವನ್ನು ಆಶ್ರಯಿಸಿ ಸತತವೂ ಪೂಜಿತಳಾಗಿ ನೀನು ಇರು. ॥೩೫॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        36
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "इत्येवं कथितं देवि मदस्य वचनं मया । कुरु त्वं भक्तराजस्य पालनं परमादरात् ॥३६॥",
      "text": "ಹೇ ದೇವಿಯೇ, ಹೀಗೆ ಮದನ ವಚನವು ನನ್ನಿಂದ ಹೇಳಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು; ಭಕ್ತರಾಜನ ಪಾಲನೆಯನ್ನು ನೀನು ಪರಮ ಆದರದಿಂದ ಮಾಡು. ॥೩೬॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        37
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "गृत्समद उवाच । मदस्य वचनं क्रूरं तारकेण प्रकाशितम् । तच्छ्रुत्वा कुपिता देवी तं जगाद महासुरम् ॥३७॥",
      "text": "ಗೃತ್ಸಮದರು ಹೇಳಿದರು — ತಾರಕನಿಂದ ಪ್ರಕಾಶಪಡಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಮದನ ಕ್ರೂರವಾದ ವಚನವನ್ನು ಕೇಳಿ, ಕುಪಿತಳಾದ ದೇವಿಯು ಆ ಮಹಾಸುರನಿಗೆ ಹೇಳಿದಳು. ॥೩೭॥",
      "type": "translation",
      "review_status": "accepted",
      "classification": {
        "category": "narrative_or_stotra",
        "required_treatment": "formal Kannada translation",
        "rationale": "Narrativestotrameaning;invocationsseparatetransliteration;noinventedmantras."
      },
      "issues": [],
      "independent_review": {
        "status": "accepted",
        "scope": "language_and_context_only_source_pixels_checked_by_integrator",
        "attribution": "Parentindependentreviewofall71entriesplus2colophonsandinvocation;minimalcorrectionsapplied;pixelverificationbyintegratoronly."
      }
    },
    {
      "key": [
        2,
        46,
        38
      ],
      "source_pages": "pdf:e83d469bf798f33985a2b0e3ad2ce8c68e86e87a6fee974f696da6290c5bc60f:p45",
      "source_sanskrit": "शक्तिरुवाच । मदीयं जगदंबेति नाम वेदे प्रकाशितम् । केन मार्गेण दैत्येश पक्षमेकं समाश्रये ॥३८॥",
      "text": "ಶಕ್ತಿಯು ಹೇಳಿದಳು — ಜಗದಂಬೆ ಎಂಬ ನನ್ನ ನಾಮವು ವೇದದಲ್ಲಿ ಪ್ರಕಾಶಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿದೆ; ಹೇ ದೈತ್ಯೇಶನೇ, ಯಾವ ಮಾರ್ಗದಿಂದ ನಾನು ಒಂದೇ ಪಕ್ಷವನ್ನು ಆಶ್ರಯಿಸಲಿ? ॥೩೮॥",
